{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65dc26b91479222cc1981efb95199653c279def62e79e5d6714dfb33f48cdf2e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72292a3e760687635368b458a906249b9cd310fab442790512ba130aed42b00",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄顺利结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3dca6cddf1be4eef30146bfe48e95fe28eaf346c5a042a0c51e84eb3de56a87",
      "text": "刚好还有点时间，我现在正准备回一趟事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f48633dff5504aff9e06fa20e900740c8819384a8b7f194a5c9dded25a1df0df",
      "text": "角色揣摩的成果\n能发挥出来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a1b0a76a7dd11365e399f81bff233599d3c267564e5574beea84bba27697025",
      "text": "拍摄进展顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f0e573d244bc05cdff28cab85f6555d6c9e2157a71394c07170fd5167769152",
      "text": "是的。已经完全融入角色了，\n拍摄正在顺利推进哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e006b4bf5cd5aecb0ac7a88dbc356fcab51869b3c1142e1f087882c6b61d1cd7",
      "text": "演员和工作人员全都是非常热忱的人，\n商讨和准备工作也都很细致。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbce8e332e6ae68f8aefbc5dd24ffe02719dc238f3070fae97bce078b7480b0",
      "text": "尤其是和眉见先生，经常一起练习对戏，\n或是闲聊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78692b6d4268eff17816e2f86721a64c5a10b3d4a8d0cf0bec3b36861a8aeddf",
      "text": "毕竟在这部电视剧里，也有需要我们两人\n节奏紧凑地展开对话的场面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41248adc60ea4f9049a393b4f446d7587fe2e985f49645afc37589ea9cdcd441",
      "text": "我觉得随意的闲聊，也算是一种\n塑造角色的过程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e0e215896a8a83340aa9bd07b814b17e24612bbdc0ea021272f7f31cd7f6d5b",
      "text": "作为被委以主角重任的立场，为了能献出\n不愧于这份重托的演技，我会继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_b:2_4_028_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d2e79e335a3ace754f9451d32d30c23d5e1e396e2259535aa91f67a5ffe03fc",
      "text": "那么，稍后再联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
